   "title": "Child with STRIDOR: where is the narrowing, and WHAT is it?",
   "lines": [
    "INSPIRATORY = supraglottic or glottic · BIPHASIC = subglottic · EXPIRATORY = lower airway",
    "a child's airway is narrowest at the CRICOID: a complete ring that cannot expand",
    "less likely: subglottic stenosis (scarring after intubation), subglottic hemangioma, vocal cord paralysis"
